assion Fruit Mango","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Kiwi Ice","offer_id":42016179617847,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Strawberry Kiwi","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blueberry Raspberry Grape","offer_id":42016179650615,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Blueberry Raspberry Grape","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Strawberry Watermelon Ice","offer_id":42016179683383,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Strawberry Watermelon Ice","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Passion Fruit Kiwi Guava","offer_id":42016179716151,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Passion Fruit Kiwi Guava","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Cherry Pomegranate","offer_id":42016179748919,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Cherry Pomegranate","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blackberry Cherry Pomegranate","offer_id":42016179781687,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Blackberry Cherry Pomegranate","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jasmine Mint","offer_id":42023570374711,"sku":"I Soul (40K P) - Jasmine Mint","price":2599.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/iget-soul-blackberry-ice.webp?v=1765233508"},{"product_id":"adalya-ad40000-40000-puffs","title":"Adalya AD40000 (40000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Adalya Aurora 40K is a premium high-tech disposable vape built for a dual mesh coil— giving you full control over vapour density and flavour intensity. It’s the most advanced Adalya disposable ever, delivering a true Turkish shisha-style experience in a compact all-in-one device.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEquipped with an LED display, Ice\/Nic control, and adjustable wattage, this Adalya flavour vape reaches up to 40,000 puffs, delivering premium performance and flavor in a compact and modern design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKey features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePremium Turkish Flavours\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUp to 40,000 puffs\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDigital LED display with power control\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjusting ICE and nicotine levels\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C charging port\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLiquid capacity: approx. 25 ml\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e850mAh rechargeable battery\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh coil for greater purity and flavor intensity\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGerman manufacturing with high quality standards\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IGET","offers":[{"title":"Blue melon","offer_id":42030462009399,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Blue Melon","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lady Killer","offer_id":42030465941559,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Lady Killer","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Love66","offer_id":42030465974327,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Love 66","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Punkman","offer_id":42030466039863,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Punkman","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Very Berry","offer_id":42030466105399,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Verry Berry","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Peach Ice","offer_id":42030466138167,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Peach Ice","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Double Melon Ice","offer_id":42030466170935,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Double Melon Ice","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Havana","offer_id":42030466203703,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Havana","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Hawaii","offer_id":42030466236471,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Hawaii","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Two Apples","offer_id":42030466269239,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Two Apples","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Watermelon Ice","offer_id":42030466302007,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Watermelon Ice","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Apple Peach","offer_id":42030459879479,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Apple Peach","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Fresh Lime","offer_id":42030465908791,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Fresh Lime","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Cola Dragon","offer_id":42030465876023,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Cola Dragon","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Mintpoint","offer_id":42030466007095,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Mintpoint","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sweet Custard Tobacco","offer_id":42030466072631,"sku":"Adalya AD40K (40K P) - Sweet Custard Tobacco","price":2650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/adalya-40K-apple-peach-hypermax-vape.webp?v=1766456707"},{"product_id":"iget-move-50000-puffs","title":"IGET Move (50000 Puffs)","description":"\u003cp\u003eIGET Move B50000 positions itself at the high end of the \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/disposable-vapes\" title=\"disposable vape\"\u003edisposable vape\u003c\/a\u003e market, offering a massive puff count, a digital display, and—its most unique feature—the ability to switch between two different flavors in a single device. This makes it an appealing option for vapers seeking convenience, longevity, and flavor variety without committing to a single taste profile all day.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual-Flavor Technology: This is the standout innovation. The IGET Move allows users to toggle between two distinct flavor profiles simply by rotating a section of the device.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDigital Screen Display: A clear digital screen allows users to easily monitor both the remaining battery life and the e-liquid level. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMesh Coil Technology: Equipped with a 0.9O Mesh \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-coils-pods\" title=\"vape coil\"\u003evape Coil\u003c\/a\u003e, the IGET Move delivers excellent vapor quality. \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRechargeable Battery: The device includes an 850mAh rechargeable battery, with inclusion of type C port.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"IGET","offers":[{"title":"Dragon Fruit + Strawberry Banana Dragon Fruit","offer_id":42085555568695,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Dragon Fruit + Strawberry Banana Dragon Fruit","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"Passion Fruit Mango Ice + Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava","offer_id":42085555666999,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Passion Fruit Mango Ice + Kiwi Passion Fruit Guava","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Original Monster + Blue Monster","offer_id":42085555699767,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Original Monster + Blue Monster","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Mr Blue + Blueberry Sour Raspberry","offer_id":42085555732535,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Mr Blue + Blueberry Sour Raspberry","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Lush Ice + Watermelon Blueberry","offer_id":42085555765303,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Lush Ice + Watermelon Blueberry","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grape Ice + Blackcurrant","offer_id":42085572673591,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Grape Ice + Blackcurrant","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"Raspberry Ice + Grape Cranberry Blueberry Raspberry","offer_id":42085572739127,"sku":"I Move (50K P) - Raspberry Ice + Grape Cranberry Blueberry Raspberry","price":3150.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":tr